full-query: "Company ABC has started to use AWS Service Catalog to manage its CloudFormation stacks within the company. In Service Catalog, several portfolios have been created with relevant products configured. It is supposed to assign access to different users or teams for these different products. For example, for one important payment service, only DevOps team can create, modify or delete the product. In Service Catalog, how should you manage the user access?"
